# Contact form endpoint. The footer posts JSON here, so the built site never
# contains a personal email address. Works with Formspree, Web3Forms, Basin,
# or your own serverless route. Leave empty to keep the form in its current
# disabled state (LinkedIn remains the fallback).
#
# Local:  copy to .env.local and fill in
# Vercel: Project Settings -> Environment Variables -> VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
